{
 "id": "c2bc45c3-05dd-40ba-a3e5-07f70ba65f33",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "I Don't Want to Die, So I'm Going to Raise a Hero"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "死にたくないので英雄様を育てる事に します"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Shinitakunai node Eiyuu-sama wo Sodateru Koto ni Shimasu"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A university student named Osaka Nao reincarnates as the villainous young master Lian in a game. He is tasked with raising the future hero Alfredo into a capable man and making him fulfill his mission to save the world. Despite Lian's efforts to be disliked, it has no effect... In fact, Alfredo seems to like him...!? While Lian grows increasingly anxious, Alfredo keeps getting closer and closer...!?\n\n“Hey, is it okay if I touch you more?” The unrefined hero's unconscious pampering makes Lian's heart race—unavoidable heart-throbbing moments. (Source: justforbookmarking @ Batoto, modified)",
   "ja": "ゲームの悪役令息・リアンに転生した大学生・直（なお）。\n未来の英雄様アルフレドを立派に育て、世界を救う使命をかせられた。\nシナリオ通り、嫌われようと頑張るものの、全く効果なし。というか好かれてる…!?\n焦るリアンをよそに、アルフレドがどんどん迫ってきて――!?\n\n「なあ、もっと触っていいか？」\n（原：pixivコミック）"
  },
